      "4. Record the arrival times of at least three successive back-wall echoes and compute their spacing.",
      "5. Measure the peak-to-peak amplitude of each echo, correcting for the gain settings used.",
      "6. Repeat the measurement with transducers of different centre frequencies to test the frequency dependence of attenuation.",
