      "4. Label each operation and verify that composing any two operations gives another operation already in the list.",
      "5. Fill in the complete composition table and check that each row and column contains each element exactly once.",
      "6. Identify the order of the group, its subgroups and whether it is isomorphic to a known cyclic or dihedral group.",
      "7. Repeat for at least three different models and compare their symmetry groups.",
